      471.68,
      286.44,
      573.92
    ],
    "text": "The lands allotments of Five (5) in total extent of about 3.9135 Hectares, shown as Lot Nos. 1-5 in the preliminary plan dated 02.12.2016 for Gam 3996 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village of Nawammahara, the Regam Paththuwa Minor Divison in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 179 Elapitiwala, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wattala in the District of Gampaha, in Western Province and bounded as follows.",
