    "text": "5. Lot No. 05 Name of Land: \u2014; Description: Road; Claimant: Sherman Sons Company, No. 194G, Nawala Road, Narahenpita, Colombo 05; Extent: 0.0089 Hectare. All the Persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office of Wattala, on the 08th day of March 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 08th day of March 2017, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
